{"1624840": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Super Chesslike Adventure", "steam_appid": 1624840, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience the familiarity of chess in a fantastic new world of possibilities. Explore an open world as a party of chess pieces in search of corrupt kings that need <i>liberating</i> of their crown's duties. Beware the magical queens that protect them. Equip items to gain magical powers. Create your own scenes in the level editor, and command respect in the online PvP arena.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1624840/extras/9806cf7e52b70d6ec12c487414375c64.poster.avif?t=1782832865\" width=616 height=282 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1624840/extras/9806cf7e52b70d6ec12c487414375c64.webm?t=1782832865\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1624840/extras/9806cf7e52b70d6ec12c487414375c64.mp4?t=1782832865\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >OPEN WORLD FEATURES:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Varied and interesting environments, from lush forests to dry deserts.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Colorful cast of characters.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find and complete quests from every corner of the globe.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Secrets around every corner.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1624840/extras/4f4f30ba99e3a79d34f48b0cd4cc6f29.poster.avif?t=1782832865\" width=616 height=282 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1624840/extras/4f4f30ba99e3a79d34f48b0cd4cc6f29.webm?t=1782832865\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1624840/extras/4f4f30ba99e3a79d34f48b0cd4cc6f29.mp4?t=1782832865\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >ONLINE MULTIPLAYER:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play against friends or strangers with the online mulitplayer mode.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose to battle on one of dozens of unique maps.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play with specific win conditions and rulesets.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1624840/extras/64c11d23a93caa8a572fe80321a9ac90.poster.avif?t=1782832865\" width=616 height=282 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1624840/extras/64c11d23a93caa8a572fe80321a9ac90.webm?t=1782832865\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1624840/extras/64c11d23a93caa8a572fe80321a9ac90.mp4?t=1782832865\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >STORY CAMPAIGN:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore concepts of honor, liberty, and destiny in a classic adventure.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build your army and defeat the forces of oppression.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete 100+ hand crafted story levels.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p cla