ching combat puzzles that will make you think in new and creative ways.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenges that will stump even for the most grizzled Chess veterans.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy variants not possible in a classic Chess game.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1624840/extras/fed8f6d1957a7fde909b70f893e9eb29.poster.avif?t=1782832865\" width=616 height=282 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1624840/extras/fed8f6d1957a7fde909b70f893e9eb29.webm?t=1782832865\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1624840/extras/fed8f6d1957a7fde909b70f893e9eb29.mp4?t=1782832865\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >SECRETS</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find treasures and discover mysteries in every nook and cranny.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Leave no stone unturned and be rewarded with unique unlockables.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And so much more...</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience the familiarity of chess in a fantastic new world of possibilities. Explore an open world as a party of chess pieces in search of corrupt kings that need <i>liberating</i> of their crown's duties. Beware the magical queens that protect them. Equip items to gain magical powers. Create your own scenes in the level editor, and command respect in the online PvP arena.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://sh