 >Play with specific win conditions and rulesets.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1624840/extras/64c11d23a93caa8a572fe80321a9ac90.poster.avif?t=1782832865\" width=616 height=282 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1624840/extras/64c11d23a93caa8a572fe80321a9ac90.webm?t=1782832865\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1624840/extras/64c11d23a93caa8a572fe80321a9ac90.mp4?t=1782832865\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >STORY CAMPAIGN:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore concepts of honor, liberty, and destiny in a classic adventure.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build your army and defeat the forces of oppression.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete 100+ hand crafted story levels.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1624840/extras/6b52089c2cba98ccd172121304702cf4.poster.avif?t=1782832865\" width=616 height=282 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1624840/extras/6b52089c2cba98ccd172121304702cf4.webm?t=1782832865\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1624840/extras/6b52089c2cba98ccd172121304702cf4.mp4?t=1782832865\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >LEVEL EDITOR FEATURES:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><