24840/extras/fed8f6d1957a7fde909b70f893e9eb29.webm?t=1782832865\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1624840/extras/fed8f6d1957a7fde909b70f893e9eb29.mp4?t=1782832865\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >SECRETS</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find treasures and discover mysteries in every nook and cranny.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Leave no stone unturned and be rewarded with unique unlockables.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And so much more...</p></li></ul>", "short_description": "A chess-inspired tactical RPG where every piece is a character, every battle bends the rules, and every kingdom has something to hide. Explore an open world, upgrade your party, and fight to overthrow tyrants one calculated move at a time.", "supported_languages": "English", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1624840/header.jpg?t=1782832865", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1624840/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1782832865", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1624840/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1782832865", "website": "https://chesslike.net", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows XP<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Dual Core with Hyper-Threading<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Hardware Accelerated Graphics with dedicated memory, 1GB memory recommended<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 50 MB available space<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> If you can run Chrome, you should be able to run this game.</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows 7/8<br></li><li><stro